 United States has confirmed that the U.S. Government does not possess evidence that he has engaged in any unlawful conduct. On a personal note, I have gotten to know Jensen, and he is a Great Patriot and National Treasure. Separately, NVIDIA should continue its thorough internal investigation of the Company’s compliance with U.S. export controls in order to ensure that it is fulfilling its legal obligations and Patriotic Duty to protect U.S. National Security. Congratulations to Jensen, the NVIDIA Board, to the People of the United States — and, indeed, the World! Thank you for your attention to this matter. President DONALD J. TRUMP", "link": "https://www.trumpstruth.org/statuses/43714", "market": false}, {"t": 1795433493, "source": "Truth Social", "title": "Quote post from November 23, 2026", "link": "https://www.trumpstruth.org/statuses/43712", "market": false}, {"t": 1795433480, "source": "Truth Social", "title": "Video post from November 23, 2026", "link": "https://www.trumpstruth.org/statuses/43713", "market": false}, {"t": 1795410510, "source": "Truth Social", "title": "Quote post from November 23, 2026", "link": "https://www.trumpstruth.org/statuses/43711", "market": false}, {"t": 1795410463, "source": "Truth Social", "title": "Video post from November 23, 2026", "link": "https://www.trumpstruth.org/statuses/43710", "market": false}, {"t": 1795402485, "source": "Truth Social", "title": "I hope the Board of Nvidia rehires Jensen Huang. It would be the best thing for the Company, and also, for the U.S.A. President DONALD J. TRUMP", "link": "https://www.trumpstruth.org/statuses/43709", "market": false}, {"t": 1795384388, "source": "Truth Social", "title": "It’s incredible that Somalians have been able to completely take over the once great State of Minnesota. They own it, “lock, stock, and barrel” and, almost 95% are on some form of welfare. MAKE AMERICA GREAT AGAIN! President DONALD J. TRUMP", "link": "https://www.trumpstruth.org/statuses/43708", "market": false}, {"t": 1795384151, "source": "Truth Social", "title": "Isn’t it interesting that Oil prices have dropped precipitously after the Midterm Elections? I said that was going to happen. The whole thing is a Giant Hoax! President DONALD J. TRUMP", "link": "https://www.trumpstruth.org/statuses/43707", "market": true}, {"t": 1795384066, "source": "Truth Social", "title": "As everyone remembers, I predicted two things concerning the November 3rd Midterm Elections. One, that if the Democrats win, the Stock Markets would go down, substantially, which they have, and two, that the Islamic Republic of Iran, which has killed 81,000 protestors as of today, will grow more aggressive in their attacks, which has also occurred. Iran has launched more drones and missiles in the last week than at any time for over a year. Don’t worry, they’ve all been knocked down, and done no damage. Iranian leaders consider the Democrats weak, ineffective, and Country destroying, but I won’t let that happen! Both the Dems and Iran fought like hell to keep the Oil price up as long as possible and, since the Election, the Oil price has dropped by a record level. Too bad the Voters didn’t understand this before they pulled the trigger, but the whole Election was very “strange.” In the end, America will win! Thank you for your attention to this matter. President DONALD J. TRUMP", "link": "https://www.trumpstruth.org/statuses/43706", "market": false}], "whales": {"updated": 1795448534, "traders": 30, "coins": {"BTC": {"long": 9136110.920142, "short": 387222617.563676, "nb": 17, "bias": -0.954}, "ETH": {"long": 7416655.69839, "short": 188861480.18269998, "nb": 15, "bias": -0.924}, "ATOM": {"long": 156342.43392, "short": 31155.9, "nb": 3, "bias": 0.668}, "DYDX": {"long": 0.0, "short": 57616.233312, "nb": 1, "bias": -1.0}, "SOL": {"long": 14.3754, "short": 63974635.66815, "nb": 11, "bias": -1.0}, "AVAX": {"long": 206223.41285000002, "short": 521933.4562230001, "nb": 6, "bias": -0.434}, "BNB": {"long": 124